00:00:29.722 --> 00:00:33.758
can do with that capability. Let's
take a look. First, how does

10
00:00:33.758 --> 00:00:35.440
a Large Language Model work?


11
00:00:36.182 --> 00:00:38.406
You're probably familiar with
the text generation

12
00:00:38.406 --> 00:00:40.949
process where you
can give a prompt, "I

13
00:00:40.949 --> 00:00:44.444
love eating", and ask an LLM to
